<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND 96 NET RISES TO PLN 11.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND 96 NET RISES TO PLN 11.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.35 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.25 vs   2.79</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.01 vs   2.52</p>
<p> Sales		   36.44 vs  23.98</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.44 vs   6.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.77 vs  10.81</p>
<p> Operating profit    16.90 vs   9.96</p>
<p> Sales		  173.42 vs 102.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish software firm is ComputerLand</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
